// Hunger, the body: how full the stomach is, what the body has in reserve,
// and how both fall and refill (AGENCY.md §6, d17; VILLAGE.md decision 2).
//
// Cut points:
// - full, reduced, abstract, frozen: alike. Satiety and reserves are kept as
//            of `fedAt` and computed when read (src/domains_bodies.odin), so
//            nothing steps them. Satiety empties over `emptiesIn`; while it
//            is empty, reserves fall, running out over `lastsFor`; while it
//            isn't, they refill over `refillsIn`. Reserves run out, the body
//            takes a point of injury every `harmsEvery`, at every level of
//            detail, frozen included: a frozen agent doesn't decide, so
//            doesn't eat (open: DETAIL_REGIMES.md). How hunger and food work
//            below reduced is open.
// - eating:  eating.tri's food nourishes: satiety rises by the food's
//            `nourishment` (to 100 at most), applied by the body's code, not
//            by eating's.
// - weakness: weakness.tri's curves, from reserves, take attention, the
//            pace of work, perception and grip.
// - feeling: interoception feels hunger as 100 less satiety, less twice the
//            attention the agent's activities take, by bands of 10 (20 when
//            exhausted); its wake is the next band, put off to the cadence's
//            beat below full. Reserves and weakness aren't felt (open:
//            VILLAGE.md).
// - code:    src/domains_bodies.odin: the closed form, the bands' and the
//            harm's wakes; src/know_knowledge_*.odin: interoception. Only
//            what carries #Hungry gets hungry: people, here.

package hunger

// What gets hungry: a stomach, `satiety` 0 to 100, and `reserves` 0 to 100,
// both as of `fedAt`; how long the stomach takes to empty from full, the
// reserves to run out from full with the stomach empty, and to fill again
// from nothing while it isn't; and how often a body with nothing left in
// reserve is harmed.
#Hungry: {
    @component(Hungry)
    satiety:    *80 | int & >=0 & <=100            @field(content, saved, proposable, inspect)
    reserves:   *100 | int & >=0 & <=100           @field(content, saved, proposable, inspect)
    fedAt:      *0ms | time & >=0ms & <=10000d     @field(content, saved, proposable, inspect)
    emptiesIn:  *8h | time & >=100s & <=100d       @field(content, saved, inspect)
    lastsFor:   *21d | time & >=100s & <=1000d     @field(content, saved, inspect)
    refillsIn:  *7d | time & >=100s & <=1000d      @field(content, saved, inspect)
    harmsEvery: *2h | time & >=1s & <=100d         @field(content, saved, inspect)
}
